Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.33,0:00:14.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Okarin?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.49,0:00:15.12,Default,,0,0,0,,How?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.83,0:00:18.83,Default,,0,0,0,,How?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.63,0:00:25.21,Default,,0,0,0,,I can feel her. She's really here.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.55,0:00:30.30,Default,,0,0,0,,You're not a spirit?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.30,0:00:32.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you want me to call the cops?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.55,0:00:34.56,Default,,0,0,0,,I just want to know the truth!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.56,0:00:36.56,Default,,0,0,0,,You were stabbed right here...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.48,0:00:40.06,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you mean by "the truth"?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.06,0:00:41.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you stupid? Do you want to die?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.81,0:00:43.61,Default,,0,0,0,,That's Louise's famous line!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.61,0:00:45.28,Default,,0,0,0,,I saw it!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.28,0:00:46.90,Default,,0,0,0,,You were stabbed!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.24,0:00:49.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Three hours ago,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.49,0:00:51.28,Default,,0,0,0,,during Doctor Nakabachi's press conference at Radio Kaikan!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.28,0:00:53.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Okarin, try to control your delusions.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.91,0:00:56.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Doctor Nakabachi's press conference was canceled!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.66,0:00:58.12,Default,,0,0,0,,But...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.12,0:01:00.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Ms. Makise! It's almost time!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.33,0:01:02.21,Default,,0,0,0,,All right!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.21,0:01:04.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait! Are you running away?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.05,0:01:07.30,Default,,0,0,0,,You're...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.63,0:01:08.84,Default,,0,0,0,,I have a name.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.34,0:01:10.55,Default,,0,0,0,,It's Hououin...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.30,0:01:12.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Kyouma!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.23,0:01:28.44,op kara,,0,0,0,fx,{\fad(200,0)}suujuuoku mo no kodou no kazu sae
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.23,0:01:33.91,op trans,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,0)}Even the billions of heartbeats in the world
