Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.02,0:02:53.90,Title1,,0,0,0,,{\b1\i1\bord0\blur1.5\fs40\frz347.943\c&HAFACA1&\frx28\fry344\pos(1026.499,236.5)\org(1421,240)}Are Time Machines Possible?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.69,0:02:53.90,Default,,0,0,0,,I'd like to start off by thanking you all for coming here today.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.53,0:02:59.95,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't have much experience with lectures like this,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.37,0:03:02.16,Default,,0,0,0,,so I hope you'll bear with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.16,0:03:05.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Makise Kurisu's giving the lecture...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.92,0:03:08.46,Default,,0,0,0,,So she isn't a spirit, after all?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.46,0:03:09.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Still bringing that up?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.54,0:03:13.46,Default,,0,0,0,,I've been asked to speak to you about time machines.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.09,0:03:17.80,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a little different from what I talked about in my {\i1}Science Magazine{\i0} essay,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.80,0:03:20.35,Default,,0,0,0,,but I'd like to give it a try.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.93,0:03:21.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Time machines?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.97,0:03:29.73,Default,,0,0,0,,I suppose I should just start off by saying that I think time machines are nothing more than a pipe dream.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.15,0:03:33.44,Default,,0,0,0,,I'd like to spend this lecture discussing how I arrived at that conclusio—
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.44,0:03:35.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Objection!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.90,0:03:38.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Time machines are an impossibility?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.03,0:03:41.03,Default,,0,0,0,,It's far too early to conclude that!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.03,0:03:43.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Okarin, you're embarrassing yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.04,0:03:44.54,Default,,0,0,0,,You're...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.00,0:03:53.38,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't think that timing has anything to do with it.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.38,0:03:55.47,Default,,0,0,0,,It's theoretically impossible.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.47,0:03:56.92,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.68,0:04:03.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Well then, let's change the format of this lecture to a discussion.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.01,0:04:06.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe that will make it a little easier for the more stubborn people to understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.73,0:04:10.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Right? Mr. Hououin Kyouma?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.95,0:04:23.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Makise Kurisu...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.49,0:04:25.54,Default,,0,0,0,,And from this,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.54,0:04:27.87,Default,,0,0,0,,we can conclude that, in a universe based on string theory,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.87,0:04:29.92,Default,,0,0,0,,time travel is completely unrealistic.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.92,0:04:31.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Anything else to say?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.04,0:04:33.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Mr. Hououin?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.05,0:04:36.88,Default,,0,0,0,,I imagine so...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.88,0:04:40.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Then why not find some exotic matter for us,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.80,0:04:42.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Mr. Hououin?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.43,0:04:50.02,Default,,0,0,0,,That's all I have to say. But if you have any further objections, I'm listening.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.02,0:04:51.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Mr. Hououin.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.48,0:04:55.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't be so damned arrogant,\N just because you've a little bit of genius!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.98,0:05:00.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait... She must be an agent of The Organization!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.65,0:04:59.99,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}It's hot... It's so hot...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.70,0:05:02.07,Default,,0,0,0,,The lecture was, in and of itself,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.07,0:05:05.70,Default,,0,0,0,,an act of carefully planned psychological warfare, aimed at me!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.70,0:05:07.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, I'm not buying it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.21,0:05:17.38,SignE,,0,0,0,,{\be2\bord1.5\alpha&H30&\fscx57.5\fscy80\b1\3c&H90A9AD&\frx14\fry2\frz355.249\pos(976.5,297)}Yanagibayashi
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.21,0:05:17.38,SignE,,0,0,0,,{\be2\bord1.5\alpha&H30&\fscx57.5\fscy80\frz358.158\frx0\fry354\b1\3c&H90A9AD&\pos(1015.5,520.5)}Shrine
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.30,0:05:17.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Eight...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.05,0:05:21.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Nine...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.47,0:05:22.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Just one more swing.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.80,0:05:24.72,Default,,0,0,0,,You can do it!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.72,0:05:25.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Ten!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.26,0:05:28.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Way to go, Luka!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.68,0:05:29.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Okarin!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.14,0:05:35.19,Default,,0,0,0,,M-Mr. Okabe... No, Mr. Kyouma.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.19,0:05:38.36,Default,,0,0,0,,You forgot the secret words, Lukako.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.40,0:05:43.45,Default,,0,0,0,,E-El Psy... Kongre...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.45,0:05:44.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Kongroo!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.74,0:05:46.33,Default,,0,0,0,,E-Excuse me.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.62,0:05:49.00,Default,,0,0,0,,So, what did you want me to carry?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.00,0:05:50.45,Default,,0,0,0,,This is it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.45,0:05:51.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.29,0:05:55.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Mayushii can't carry all this.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.71,0:06:00.51,Default,,0,0,0,,My dad brought them, but there's too much for just us.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.51,0:06:01.59,Default,,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.59,0:06:04.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you for donating these provisions to the lab.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.51,0:06:06.47,Default,,0,0,0,,This will raise morale amongst the lab mems.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.47,0:06:09.22,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm so glad you like them...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.22,0:06:11.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Um... Well...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.35,0:06:15.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Luka practices swinging a sword daily!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.02,0:06:19.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes. I promised Oka... I mean, Mr. Kyouma.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.86,0:06:25.28,Default,,0,0,0,,When the "Magical Blade Samidare" acknowledges you as a suitable wielder,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.28,0:06:26.99,Default,,0,0,0,,it will unleash the hidden power.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.99,0:06:27.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Do not forget that.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.99,0:06:28.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.70,0:06:34.67,Default,,0,0,0,,You got such a deal on it at the weapons store... Only 980 yen!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.67,0:06:38.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Then, show me the results of your training.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.75,0:06:40.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Can you attempt an exorcism?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.42,0:06:44.05,Default,,0,0,0,,I-I suppose... But...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.05,0:06:47.85,Default,,0,0,0,,If you need a real exorcism, you should talk to my father...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.47,0:06:52.64,Default,,0,0,0,,An evil spirit has possessed my right hand!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.64,0:06:56.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Hurry and perform the exorcism, before it consumes my entire body!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.10,0:06:56.98,Default,,0,0,0,,R-Right!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.40,0:07:00.36,Default,,0,0,0,,That's a different hand than last time.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.36,0:07:02.61,Default,,0,0,0,,The evil spirit possessed this one today, okay?!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.24,0:07:04.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Urushibara Luka.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.15,0:07:07.99,Default,,0,0,0,,The mannerisms and voice of a woman...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.49,0:07:11.91,Default,,0,0,0,,No... More feminine than any woman.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.54,0:07:13.75,Default,,0,0,0,,But he's a guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.50,0:07:18.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Taller than Mayuri, but so very thin...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.00,0:07:20.25,Default,,0,0,0,,But he's a guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.67,0:07:22.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Looks great in a shrine maiden outfit...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.34,0:07:24.76,Default,,0,0,0,,But he's a guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.80,0:07:27.47,Default,,0,0,0,,It's already twilight.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.47,0:07:28.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Yet it's so hot.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.35,0:07:30.81,Default,,0,0,0,,The cicadas are crying.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.56,0:07:32.52,Default,,0,0,0,,But...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.02,0:07:35.14,Default,,0,0,0,,He's a guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.60,0:07:37.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Bye-bye!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.65,0:07:43.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Luka's so great, being able to do those exorcisms!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.11,0:07:46.11,Default,,0,0,0,,He's the scion of a shrine clan.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.16,0:07:51.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.24,0:07:55.20,Title1,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.75\alpha&H20&\bord1.5\an5\frx342\fry2\frz0.894\3c&H657E9D&\c&H657795&\fscx67.5\fscy85\pos(805.5,381)}Restricted \NArea
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.24,0:07:55.20,Title1,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.75\alpha&H20&\bord1.5\an5\frx342\fry2\frz0.894\fscx48.75\fscy61.25\c&H556A83&\3c&H52667E&\pos(790.5,547.5)}Akihabara\NPolice
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.79,0:07:57.12,Default,,0,0,0,,It's off-limits?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.12,0:08:00.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, this leads behind the Radio Kaikan.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.50,0:08:02.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Radio Kaikan...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.14,0:08:13.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Give me those.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.89,0:08:16.18,Default,,0,0,0,,You need to get to work soon, don't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.60,0:08:20.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.15,0:08:29.82,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm working late tonight, so I'll be going straight home afterwards.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.82,0:08:30.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Mayuri...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.03,0:08:35.24,Default,,0,0,0,,You truly didn't hear a scream, did you?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.24,0:08:37.41,Default,,0,0,0,,A scream? When?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.41,0:08:39.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Today, at Radio Kaikan.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.50,0:08:42.21,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't think I did.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.38,0:08:44.21,Default,,0,0,0,,I see...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.05,0:08:46.09,Default,,0,0,0,,All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.09,0:08:47.26,Default,,0,0,0,,That's fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.09,0:08:50.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, Okarin...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.30,0:08:55.10,Default,,0,0,0,,So, nobody remembers...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.85,0:08:57.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Not Mayuri.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.06,0:08:58.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Not Daru.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.48,0:08:59.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Not Makise Kurisu.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.98,0:09:00.23,SignG,,0,0,0,,{\be2\pos(823.5,654)}Open
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.23,0:09:00.35,SignG,,0,0,0,,{\be2\frz2.563\pos(774,594)}Open
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.35,0:09:00.48,SignG,,0,0,0,,{\be2\frz359.119\pos(784.5,609)\frx6\fry0}Open
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.48,0:09:00.60,SignG,,0,0,0,,{\be2\pos(840,633)\frz2.796\frx2\fry0}Open
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.60,0:09:00.90,SignG,,0,0,0,,{\be2\frz2.563\pos(894,661.5)}Open
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.90,0:09:00.98,SignG,,0,0,0,,{\be2\frz11.831\frx2\fry312\pos(1114.5,586.5)\c&H2B4355&}Open
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.98,0:09:01.06,SignG,,0,0,0,,{\be2\c&H2B4355&\frx8\fry308\frz24.765\pos(1227,577.5)}Open
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.06,0:09:01.15,SignG,,0,0,0,,{\be2\c&H2B4355&\frz26.314\frx0\fry294\pos(1330.5,529.5)}Open
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.48,0:09:01.60,SignG,,0,0,0,,{\be2\fscx122.5\fscy116.25\c&HB2D9DF&\clip(m 1060.5 544.5 l 1053 612 1069.5 679.5 1081.5 670.5 1071 606)\frz355.948\frx14\fry12\pos(939,619.5)}Closed
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.60,0:09:01.73,SignG,,0,0,0,,{\be2\fscx122.5\fscy116.25\c&HB2D9DF&\clip(m 894 592.5 l 904.5 679.5 954 697.5 955.5 652.5 940.5 612)\pos(787.5,640.5)}Closed
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.73,0:09:01.85,SignG,,0,0,0,,{\be2\fscx122.5\fscy116.25\c&HB2D9DF&\clip(m 870 603 l 874.5 627 882 670.5 940.5 682.5 910.5 615)\pos(792,639)}Closed
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.85,0:09:01.98,SignG,,0,0,0,,{\be2\fscx122.5\fscy116.25\c&HB2D9DF&\clip(m 808.5 606 l 829.5 693 867 697.5 858 660 862.5 628.5 879 606 915 603 943.5 631.5 982.5 685.5 1000.5 657 990 612 942 556.5)\pos(805.5,636)}Closed
