Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.27,0:09:06.23,Default,,0,0,0,,You're closing early today, Mr. Braun!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.23,0:09:09.82,Default,,0,0,0,,I told you not to call me that.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.82,0:09:11.86,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm interviewing a part-timer today.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.86,0:09:13.57,Default,,0,0,0,,A part-timer?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.57,0:09:16.04,Default,,0,0,0,,A dreary, declining shop run by
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.04,0:09:18.33,Default,,0,0,0,,an over-muscled old man needs a part-timer?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.08,0:09:20.71,Default,,0,0,0,,You know...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.58,0:09:23.75,Default,,0,0,0,,'Sup!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.38,0:09:31.05,Default,,0,0,0,,I heard that was the popular way to say "hi" now...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.05,0:09:33.09,Default,,0,0,0,,This can't possibly be your part-timer...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.09,0:09:34.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Is there a problem?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.14,0:09:35.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Your name?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.10,0:09:36.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Amane Suzuha.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.26,0:09:36.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Age?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.81,0:09:37.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Eighteen.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.56,0:09:38.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Reason for working here?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.47,0:09:39.89,Default,,0,0,0,,I love CRT TVs!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.89,0:09:40.35,Default,,0,0,0,,You're hired!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.35,0:09:42.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Is this a comedy routine?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.10,0:09:43.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Some kind of joke?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.06,0:09:44.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Who are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.77,0:09:45.94,Default,,0,0,0,,His name's Okabe.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.94,0:09:48.40,Default,,0,0,0,,He's an oaf who rents a room upstairs.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.40,0:09:50.61,Default,,0,0,0,,It's not Okabe! It's Hououin—
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.61,0:09:52.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Shut it! I'll double your rent.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.61,0:09:53.53,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm Okabe Rintaro.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.53,0:09:54.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Hi!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.66,0:09:56.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Say, what's in those bags?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.83,0:09:59.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Special intelligence corn that was donated to the lab.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.66,0:10:01.83,Default,,0,0,0,,If you want some, you must appropriately compensate—
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.83,0:10:02.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Corn?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.83,0:10:04.46,Default,,0,0,0,,With the little bumps?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.46,0:10:06.42,Default,,0,0,0,,So this is how it looks when it's fresh.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.42,0:10:07.50,Default,,0,0,0,,You didn't know?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.50,0:10:08.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Can I see—?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.17,0:10:09.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Whoa there.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.84,0:10:12.80,Default,,0,0,0,,The Organization has targeted many people
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.80,0:10:14.26,Default,,0,0,0,,for coming into contact with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.76,0:10:18.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Sara, Claudia, Simone...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.26,0:10:19.89,Default,,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.89,0:10:21.68,Default,,0,0,0,,If you want, we could talk about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.68,0:10:25.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't worry about him. He's just spouting crap.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.69,0:10:28.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Think what you'd like.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.86,0:10:32.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Someday, the entire world will be in the palm of my hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.99,0:10:38.87,Default,,0,0,0,,So, that's what's popular these days...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.38,0:10:57.85,Title1,,0,0,0,,{\fad(110,0)\fs75\bord3\be2\q2\c&H644D6F&\move(997.5,744,-75,751.5,113,3488)\3c&HCECAB8&\clip(180,695,1691,881)}Unknown satellite crashes near Akihabara Station, around 12:00...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.84,0:10:57.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Crashed around 12:00...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.85,0:11:00.56,Default,,0,0,0,,So, Mayuri and Daru were right...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.61,0:11:11.86,Default,,0,0,0,,The conference was canceled?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.61,0:11:11.86,SignI,,0,0,0,,{\be2\b0\fscx93.75\fscy88.75\pos(889.5,165)}Doctor Nakabachi Press Conference
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.23,0:11:14.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Makise Kurisu stabbed...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.70,0:11:23.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Was that some kind of hallucination?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.13,0:11:30.38,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}@channel
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.59,0:11:37.05,Default,,0,0,0,,John Titor?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.05,0:11:39.97,SignI,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,300)\be2\fs45\b1\c&H513E33&\t(0,2960,\fs48)\move(1474.5,505.5,1500,358.5,0,2737)}A time traveler's here! lololol
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.18,0:11:47.44,Default,,0,0,0,,SERN has a monopoly on time machines.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.77,0:11:51.32,Default,,0,0,0,,No ordinary person, nor nation, nor business can acquire one.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.86,0:11:54.82,Default,,0,0,0,,They've only used them for their own self interests,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.82,0:11:57.07,Default,,0,0,0,,bringing the world into a dystopia.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.49,0:12:00.66,Default,,0,0,0,,I came here to fulfill the noble mission of changing my present.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.16,0:12:06.91,Default,,0,0,0,,I came here to destroy the dystopia SERN has built, and once again obtain our freedom.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.91,0:12:10.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Then you claim that SERN dictates the future?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.54,0:12:12.88,Default,,0,0,0,,You're talking about the so called Grandfather Paradox, huh.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.88,0:12:13.38,SignI,,0,0,0,,{\fs52.5\fad(500,0)\bord3\an7\c&H484346&\b1\pos(12,6)\3c&HEAF6DD&}257 Name: Anonymous [sage] \NAll I can think of is the European Laboratory for Particle Physics.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.88,0:12:14.67,Default,,0,0,0,,That's been disproven.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.38,0:12:16.30,SignF,,0,0,0,,{\fs60\fad(0,500)\bord3\an7\b1\pos(12,6)\3c&HEAF6DD&\c&H67655D&}451 Name: Anonymous [sage] \NIf you time travel, can you meet yourself in the past?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.67,0:12:17.17,Default,,0,0,0,,It's possible to meet yourself in the past.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.17,0:12:19.84,Default,,0,0,0,,If you do, you simply move worldlines.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.84,0:12:20.80,SignH,,0,0,0,,{\blur1.5\frx-3\frz0.3\c&HCB7771&\move(1005,19.5,955.5,19.5,0,1938)\org(1337,33)}What's a worldline?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.84,0:12:20.80,SignH,,0,0,0,,{\blur1.5\move(1005,19.5,955.5,19.5,0,1938)\frz359.9\c&H6AB873&\frx-1\org(1353,168)}What's a worldline?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.84,0:12:20.80,SignH,,0,0,0,,{\be2\c&H86766C&\move(1005,19.5,955.5,19.5,0,1938)\frx359\org(1556,75)}What's a worldline?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.84,0:12:20.80,SignH,,0,0,0,,{\blur1.5\frx1\frz359.7\c&HCB7771&\move(957,559.5,990,559.5,29,1947)\org(621,570)}Inb4 parallel worlds.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.84,0:12:20.80,SignH,,0,0,0,,{\blur1.5\frz0.3\c&H6AB873&\frx1\move(957,559.5,990,559.5,29,1947)\org(603,603)}Inb4 parallel worlds.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.84,0:12:20.80,SignH,,0,0,0,,{\move(957,559.5,990,559.5,29,1947)}Inb4 parallel worlds.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.39,0:12:22.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Let me begin by saying
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.68,0:12:26.18,Default,,0,0,0,,that time isn't a single line, moving from the past to the future.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.18,0:12:31.65,Default,,0,0,0,,It's comprised of an infinite number of parallel lines, like rivers, called "worldlines."
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.27,0:12:36.40,Default,,0,0,0,,For example, let's say a serial killer was to murder you today.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.74,0:12:39.74,Default,,0,0,0,,If I came from the future and prevented it,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.74,0:12:41.70,Default,,0,0,0,,the world would diverge into two lines:
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.70,0:12:46.25,Default,,0,0,0,,a world in which you had survived\N and a world in which you had died.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.08,0:12:51.96,Default,,0,0,0,,So, this Titor is Japanese, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.96,0:12:54.42,Default,,0,0,0,,A self-proclaimed time traveler,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.42,0:12:57.59,Default,,0,0,0,,who appeared on the American Internet, in the year 2000.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.63,0:13:03.85,Default,,0,0,0,,He claimed to have come from the year 2036 in order to save the future.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.68,0:13:08.98,Default,,0,0,0,,He then became famous on the Internet, and several books were eventually published about him.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.98,0:13:13.44,Default,,0,0,0,,But I didn't think I'd see some idiot pretending to be Titor {\i1}now{\i0}.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.27,0:13:13.44,SignI,,0,0,0,,{\fs52.5\fad(200,0)\bord3\an7\b1\pos(12,6)\3c&HFFEFD6&\c&H5A524B&}618 Name: Anonymous [sage] \NPretending to be? Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.40,0:13:17.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Then let's click this link and read up on Titor!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.03,0:13:22.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Daru must've deleted the link on Titor...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.53,0:13:26.74,SignI,,0,0,0,,{\bord0.45\fs105\be2\pos(1126.5,652.5)\c&H7AB07C&\3c&H7AB07C&}John Titor            About 12 Results
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.53,0:13:26.74,SignI,,0,0,0,,{\fs105\blur3\pos(1132.5,657)\c&H9C554F&}John Titor            About 12 Results
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.53,0:13:26.74,SignI,,0,0,0,,{\fs105\be2\pos(1129.5,654)\c&H544130&}John Titor            About 12 Results
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.74,0:13:28.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Twelve?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.41,0:13:29.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Impossible.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.29,0:13:32.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Sure, it was ten years ago, but it was huge!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.17,0:13:35.25,Default,,0,0,0,,It can't be!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.25,0:13:37.09,SignI,,0,0,0,,{\bord0.45\fs105\be2\c&H7AB07C&\3c&H7AB07C&\pos(841.5,604.5)}John Titor      About 56 results
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.25,0:13:37.09,SignI,,0,0,0,,{\fs105\blur3\c&H9C554F&\pos(843,606)}John Titor      About 56 results
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.25,0:13:37.09,SignI,,0,0,0,,{\fs105\be2\pos(843,606)\c&H544332&}John Titor      About 56 results
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.09,0:13:38.13,Default,,0,0,0,,They're not here!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.13,0:13:39.88,Default,,0,0,0,,They're not here! What is this?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.30,0:13:42.26,Default,,0,0,0,,I had a book collection on him, right here.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.26,0:13:43.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.52,0:13:50.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Hello?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.27,0:13:50.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Daru?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.89,0:13:51.94,Default,,0,0,0,,What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.31,0:13:53.52,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm at Faris'—
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.52,0:13:54.40,Default,,0,0,0,,What happened to the books?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.40,0:13:55.94,Default,,0,0,0,,The books?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.94,0:13:57.90,Default,,0,0,0,,The books on John Titor.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.19,0:14:00.65,Default,,0,0,0,,I had a bunch of them on the bookshelf, didn't I?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.65,0:14:01.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Where'd they all go?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.49,0:14:02.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, Okarin?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.91,0:14:03.86,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.37,0:14:08.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Who's... John Titor?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.50,0:14:15.21,Default,,0,0,0,,I stayed up most of the night looking into John Titor.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.71,0:14:19.30,Default,,0,0,0,,I found every bit of information on the Internet that I could.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.63,0:14:20.67,Default,,0,0,0,,{\t(100,900,\1c&HFFFFFF&\2c&HFFFFFF&\3c&HFFFFFF&\4c&HFFFFFF&)}But...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.42,0:14:24.09,Default,,0,0,0,,I want an answer from Titor.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.51,0:14:27.47,Default,,0,0,0,,About ten years ago... In other words, the year 2000.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.01,0:14:30.18,Default,,0,0,0,,It's interesting that you should ask that.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.64,0:14:34.77,Default,,0,0,0,,But unfortunately, I've never been to the year 2000.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.19,0:14:37.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Nor do I intend to go there.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.37,0:14:53.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey! Wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.21,0:14:56.00,Default,,0,0,0,,You there! You! You!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.00,0:14:59.17,Default,,0,0,0,,You took my picture, didn't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.17,0:15:01.34,Default,,0,0,0,,You should delete it! For your own sake!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.59,0:15:04.55,Default,,0,0,0,,I apologize
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.05,0:15:06.84,Default,,0,0,0,,if I've made you unhappy.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.22,0:15:10.31,Default,,0,0,0,,What were you taking pictures of?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.89,0:15:12.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Proof.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.43,0:15:20.69,Default,,0,0,0,,{\t(5237,7155,\1c&HFFFFFF&\2c&HFFFFFF&\3c&HFFFFFF&\4c&HFFFFFF&)}Of where I walked today... Of what I saw.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.19,0:15:25.61,Default,,0,0,0,,I want to ask you about something.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.20,0:15:28.99,Default,,0,0,0,,This.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.83,0:15:32.37,Default,,0,0,0,,That's a retro PC.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.37,0:15:33.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you recognize it?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.50,0:15:34.71,Default,,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.71,0:15:36.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you know anyone who might?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.21,0:15:38.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Daru, maybe...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.17,0:15:39.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Who is that?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.88,0:15:41.55,Default,,0,0,0,,He has nothing to do with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.55,0:15:43.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Delete that photo.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.72,0:15:46.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Tell me...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.80,0:15:47.84,Default,,0,0,0,,The e-mail...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.84,0:15:48.97,Default,,0,0,0,,For that person.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.97,0:15:50.64,Default,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.64,0:15:56.39,Default,,0,0,0,,You... Are you threatening me?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.39,0:15:57.94,Default,,0,0,0,,If you tell me,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.94,0:15:58.90,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll delete it.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.23,0:16:04.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Very well.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.28,0:16:07.32,Default,,0,0,0,,But I won't sell out my friends!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.32,0:16:09.53,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll give you my own e-mail.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.24,0:16:12.53,Default,,0,0,0,,What's your name?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.53,0:16:15.41,Default,,0,0,0,,It says "Hououin Kyouma" right there!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.41,0:16:17.37,CellphoneL,,0,0,0,,{\an5\be2\bord0\fs105\frx358\pos(1138.5,256.5)\frz359.19}Hououin Kyouma
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.25,0:16:20.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Give me that.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.30,0:16:30.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Just send me a blank mail.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.01,0:16:31.35,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll send something back.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.22,0:16:37.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Welcome back, Master!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.14,0:16:39.60,Default,,0,0,0,,It's Okarin!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.06,0:16:43.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Welcome, Okarin!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.40,0:16:45.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Yo, Mayuri.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.86,0:16:49.45,Default,,0,0,0,,When I'm working, it's Mayushii NyanNyan!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.45,0:16:53.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Come to think of it, "Okarin" kind of sounds like "Welcome."
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.28,0:16:54.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Where's Daru?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.29,0:16:57.08,Default,,0,0,0,,He's in the back.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.08,0:16:58.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Kyouma!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.54,0:17:00.21,Default,,0,0,0,,I've missed you.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.21,0:17:03.29,Default,,0,0,0,,What happened to visiting every three days?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.29,0:17:04.29,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.29,0:17:06.34,Default,,0,0,0,,The Organization's sabotage has been just awful...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.34,0:17:08.63,Default,,0,0,0,,The Organization's gone that far?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.63,0:17:11.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Then you'll hold another secret meeting today to decide how to defeat them?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.34,0:17:12.34,Default,,0,0,0,,That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.34,0:17:14.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Give me the usual Stealth Field.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.39,0:17:15.43,Default,,0,0,0,,On it!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.43,0:17:16.56,Default,,0,0,0,,I wish you'd let me join in!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.56,0:17:17.60,Default,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.60,0:17:19.98,Default,,0,0,0,,The Organization is far too vast for you to handle!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.89,0:17:23.86,Default,,0,0,0,,But I've got my forbidden special move...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.86,0:17:24.73,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.73,0:17:27.15,Default,,0,0,0,,You finally mastered it?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.15,0:17:28.74,Default,,0,0,0,,That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.74,0:17:31.03,Default,,0,0,0,,After overcoming months of harsh training in the Highlands of Guiana
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.03,0:17:34.20,Default,,0,0,0,,and the death of my master, at last I...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.95,0:17:37.08,Default,,0,0,0,,I've mastered it!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.08,0:17:39.75,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll never forgive you. Ever.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.33,0:17:44.54,Default,,0,0,0,,So, about what I said in my mail...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.54,0:17:47.46,Default,,0,0,0,,I believe talking to a winner makes me a loser.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.63,0:17:50.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.01,0:17:52.43,Default,,0,0,0,,I've no interest in that girl and her lies.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.80,0:17:56.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Is this today's "you're the last one I want to hear that from" thread?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.14,0:17:57.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Shut up, cheater!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.97,0:17:59.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Your 2D wives are crying.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.52,0:18:00.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Faris is special!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.89,0:18:03.60,Default,,0,0,0,,She may be 3D, but she has a 2D soul!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.60,0:18:05.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Anyway, look at this picture.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.77,0:18:07.40,Default,,0,0,0,,This is it.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.65,0:18:11.24,Default,,0,0,0,,That's an IBN 5100, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.24,0:18:12.45,Default,,0,0,0,,IBN?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.03,0:18:15.20,Default,,0,0,0,,A legendary retro PC.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.20,0:18:17.24,Default,,0,0,0,,I think it was about a month ago...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.24,0:18:20.41,Default,,0,0,0,,I heard a rumor that there was one somewhere in Akihabara.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.41,0:18:21.91,Default,,0,0,0,,She must've heard about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.91,0:18:22.50,Default,,0,0,0,,What happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.50,0:18:24.25,Default,,0,0,0,,No one ever found it.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.25,0:18:27.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Not even the famous "Lightning Fast Neidhardt" could find it.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.29,0:18:31.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Which means it probably never existed in the first place, and that's my final answer.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.09,0:18:32.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Is it that valuable?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.88,0:18:36.43,Default,,0,0,0,,It was sold over thirty years ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.43,0:18:40.64,Default,,0,0,0,,At the time, nobody bought PCs. They were too expensive.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.64,0:18:42.39,Default,,0,0,0,,That's how stuff ends up incredibly rare.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.23,0:18:48.19,Default,,0,0,0,,That girl...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.65,0:18:50.73,Default,,0,0,0,,I sent that mail...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.73,0:18:53.49,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm Kiryu Moeka...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.61,0:18:57.70,CellphoneL,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,0)\an7\b0\fs37.5\c&HEDE6E8&\pos(37.5,16.5)}Sender: The Lightning Masseuse \NSubject: I'm waiting \NHououin, I sent that mail! I'm Kiryu Moeka! Age 20! No real job! \NI can mail you, right? I'm sending it, whether you like it or not! Moeka
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.49,0:18:57.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Age 20... No real job... \NI'm sending it, whether you like it or not...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.70,0:19:01.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Is this the same girl I just talked to?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.29,0:19:02.33,Default,,0,0,0,,What's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.16,0:19:05.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Be glad I didn't sell you out.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.92,0:19:07.38,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a rare and valuable PC,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.38,0:19:10.13,Default,,0,0,0,,but there's a good chance it's not in Akihabara.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.63,0:19:13.59,Default,,0,0,0,,El Psy Kongroo.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.01,0:19:15.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Master!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.30,0:19:17.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Here you go, Nyan Nyan!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.35,0:19:19.89,SignJ,,0,0,0,,{\bord1.5\be2\frz338.281\fscx90\fscy80\frx4\fry354\c&H4E5C84&\b1\3c&H495977&\pos(828,246)}The
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.35,0:19:19.89,SignJ,,0,0,0,,{\be2\bord1.5\c&H4E5C84&\frz335.052\fscx106.25\fscy105\b0\3c&H495977&\pos(997.5,321)}World's
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.35,0:19:19.89,SignJ,,0,0,0,,{\be2\bord1.5\c&H4E5C84&\3c&H495977&\fscx67.5\fscy92.5\frx10\fry14\frz332.748\pos(1242,451.5)}In Danger ! !
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.89,0:19:20.97,Default,,0,0,0,,It's my "The World is in Danger" omelet!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.97,0:19:22.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Yummy...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.43,0:19:24.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Calm down.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.73,0:19:28.90,SignJ,,0,0,0,,The World is in Danger!!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.40,0:19:34.86,Default,,0,0,0,,The analysis conducted by the university laboratory
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.86,0:19:36.11,Default,,0,0,0,,reveals that the gel-banas
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.11,0:19:37.86,Default,,0,0,0,,have been torn apart at a molecular level.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.66,0:19:42.83,Default,,0,0,0,,So they turned into something that was no longer a banana.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.87,0:19:45.12,Default,,0,0,0,,That's bad, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.12,0:19:46.79,Default,,0,0,0,,What's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.33,0:19:49.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Right now, the only thing that comes to mind
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.63,0:19:53.13,Default,,0,0,0,,is the EM-wave effect of the PhoneWave (name subject to change).
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.13,0:19:54.38,Default,,0,0,0,,What makes you think that?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.38,0:19:56.72,Default,,0,0,0,,My intuition as a mad scientist.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.72,0:19:58.39,Default,,0,0,0,,So, no reason.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.39,0:20:00.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, it's all set.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.60,0:20:02.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Then let's use these.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.31,0:20:11.77,SignJ,,0,0,0,,{\blur1.95\alpha&H30&\frz315.525\frx2\fry352\move(1669.5,190.5,1594.5,205.5,0,9449)}Property of Mayushii
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.43,0:20:06.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Aren't these Mayushii's?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.14,0:20:07.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.44,0:20:10.94,Default,,0,0,0,,I bought them with research funds Mayuri donated to the lab.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.44,0:20:12.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Doesn't that make them hers—?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.57,0:20:15.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, let's toss the whole thing in and see the effect.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.61,0:20:17.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Wouldn't just one work? Dumbass.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.12,0:20:24.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Can we really uncover the PhoneWave (name subject to change)'s true power
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.04,0:20:25.50,Default,,0,0,0,,that way?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.50,0:20:29.29,Default,,0,0,0,,That (name subject to change) thing is annoying. We should get rid of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.76,0:20:37.92,Default,,0,0,0,,We can't overhaul the world's ruling structure
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.92,0:20:40.97,Default,,0,0,0,,if we're stingy with experimental funding!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.97,0:20:43.31,Default,,0,0,0,,You're the only one who wants to, you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.31,0:20:44.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.85,0:20:46.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.60,0:20:48.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, done.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.61,0:20:53.52,Default,,0,0,0,,What's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.52,0:20:54.48,Default,,0,0,0,,It's gone...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.48,0:20:55.57,Default,,0,0,0,,The banana's gone!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.44,0:20:57.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Impossible!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.86,0:21:02.07,Default,,0,0,0,,It's me.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.07,0:21:03.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Execute Emergency Order 666.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.87,0:21:05.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Initiate the cool-off!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.91,0:21:07.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Government approval?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.37,0:21:09.12,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no time for that!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.12,0:21:10.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Talking to yourself... weirdo!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.37,0:21:11.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Shut up!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.42,0:21:12.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Where'd you hide it?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.21,0:21:15.42,Default,,0,0,0,,What? You're the one who hid it, Okarin.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.76,0:21:18.80,Default,,0,0,0,,I see... I understand!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.80,0:21:21.38,Default,,0,0,0,,This must be some kind of teleporter microwave!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.38,0:21:23.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Wh-What?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.89,0:21:25.89,Default,,0,0,0,,That's insane.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.89,0:21:27.52,Default,,0,0,0,,How else do you explain this?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.52,0:21:30.85,Default,,0,0,0,,We took the banana from the bunch, put it into the microwave, and...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.40,0:21:42.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Gel... bana...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.82,0:21:46.66,Default,,0,0,0,,But it's completely connected to the rest of the bunch...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.66,0:21:49.62,Default,,0,0,0,,A second ago... We definitely removed one, didn't we?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.62,0:21:51.04,Default,,0,0,0,,I think so...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.04,0:21:54.38,Default,,0,0,0,,It's really a teleporter?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.38,0:21:56.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Is that what it is?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.46,0:22:00.84,Default,,0,0,0,,That's an interesting experiment you're conducting there, Okabe Rintaro.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.84,0:22:04.34,Default,,0,0,0,,No, Mr. Hououin Kyouma, was it?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.81,0:22:11.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Makise Kurisu?
Dialogue: 1,0:22:21.19,0:22:30.25,EDRom,,0,0,0,,{\blur1.8\fad(250,1500)}kisei sareta shikai mujihi naru
