Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.19,0:22:30.25,EDTL,,0,0,0,,{\blur4.8\\alpha&H70&\bord8.25\3c&H5E382E&\fad(250,1500)}With my field of view restricted
Dialogue: 1,0:22:30.25,0:22:37.84,EDRom,,0,0,0,,{\blur1.8\fad(250,300)}juuni no shihai nogarerarenai
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.25,0:22:37.84,EDRom,,0,0,0,,{\blur4.8\\alpha&H70&\bord8.25\3c&H5E382E&\fad(250,300)}juuni no shihai nogarerarenai
Dialogue: 1,0:22:30.25,0:22:37.84,EDTL,,0,0,0,,{\blur1.8\fad(250,300)}I cannot escape the merciless control of the twelve
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.25,0:22:37.84,EDTL,,0,0,0,,{\blur4.8\\alpha&H70&\bord8.25\3c&H5E382E&\fad(250,300)}I cannot escape the merciless control of the twelve
